{"ref":"core-es:item:002157","lang":"en","text":"The page has a lot of useful information.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002158","lang":"en","text":"The information in the advert is not right.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002159","lang":"en","text":"The new law protects the environment.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002160","lang":"en","text":"It is unlikely they will change the law.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002161","lang":"en","text":"The law is the same for everybody.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002162","lang":"en","text":"The parcel arrived broken.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002163","lang":"en","text":"I sent the parcel by post.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002164","lang":"en","text":"This page has an odd error on it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002165","lang":"en","text":"It is odd that it happens twice.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002166","lang":"en","text":"It is an odd fact, but it is true.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002167","lang":"en","text":"I recommend this English course to you.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002168","lang":"en","text":"I would advise you to use public transport.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002169","lang":"en","text":"I did the course online.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002170","lang":"en","text":"The atmosphere on the course is very good.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002171","lang":"en","text":"I keep the data on the computer.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002172","lang":"en","text":"The data in the document is correct.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002173","lang":"en","text":"I look up the transport timetable online.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002174","lang":"en","text":"Public transport cuts pollution.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002175","lang":"en","text":"I propose a simple solution.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002176","lang":"en","text":"They proposed a new course for September.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002177","lang":"en","text":"I suggest this page for practising at home.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002178","lang":"en","text":"I suggest another part of the city.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002179","lang":"en","text":"It is not a serious illness.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002180","lang":"en","text":"The company laid off ten people.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002181","lang":"en","text":"It is unlikely to arrive today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002182","lang":"en","text":"Good morning. Why do you want this post?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002183","lang":"en","text":"Because I have experience and I want a steady job.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002184","lang":"en","text":"The contract is temporary for the first few months.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002185","lang":"en","text":"That is no problem. I am willing to start on that basis.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002186","lang":"en","text":"It is important that you arrive early.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002187","lang":"en","text":"Of course. What are the hours?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002188","lang":"en","text":"Nine to five, with an hour for lunch.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002189","lang":"en","text":"Very good. When will you know the decision?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002190","lang":"en","text":"We will let you know when the interviews are over.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002191","lang":"en","text":"Thank you. I hope it is soon.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002192","lang":"en","text":"I bought this shirt on Saturday and it arrived broken.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002193","lang":"en","text":"I am very sorry. Do you have the receipt?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002194","lang":"en","text":"Yes, here it is. I want my money back.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002195","lang":"en","text":"Would you rather have another shirt or the money?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002196","lang":"en","text":"The money, thank you. It is not the first time this has happened.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002197","lang":"en","text":"I apologise. It is odd that it should happen twice.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002198","lang":"en","text":"I hope it does not happen again.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002889","lang":"en","text":"When does the money reach my account?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002890","lang":"en","text":"In two or three days.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002891","lang":"en","text":"I hope it is before the weekend.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002892","lang":"en","text":"I will email you when it is done.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002893","lang":"en","text":"I am grateful to you.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002199","lang":"en","text":"We will give you your money back today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002200","lang":"en","text":"I want us to talk about the noise at night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002201","lang":"en","text":"You are right. Does the music bother you?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002202","lang":"en","text":"Yes, and what is more I cannot sleep.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002203","lang":"en","text":"It is only natural that you are tired. I will turn the music down.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002204","lang":"en","text":"Let me suggest something: no music after eleven.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002205","lang":"en","text":"OK, that seems fair to me.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002206","lang":"en","text":"And it is better if we share the electricity costs.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002207","lang":"en","text":"Agreed. I will draw up a budget for the month.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002208","lang":"en","text":"In my kitchen there are three bags for recycling.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002209","lang":"en","text":"In one I throw the paper, in another the plastic.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002210","lang":"en","text":"I have been recycling for two years and by now it is normal.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002211","lang":"en","text":"The first few months it was complicated, but now it is straightforward.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002212","lang":"en","text":"It is important that we all recycle.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002213","lang":"en","text":"If we cut down on plastic, the air and the sea are cleaner.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002214","lang":"en","text":"Even if it is little, every effort counts.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002637","lang":"en","text":"At first I did not know where to throw each thing.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002638","lang":"en","text":"A neighbour explained it to me in five minutes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002639","lang":"en","text":"Now I recycle bottles as well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002640","lang":"en","text":"In my street there is a place for paper.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002641","lang":"en","text":"It is better if we buy less plastic.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002642","lang":"en","text":"It annoys me that there is still rubbish in the street.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002215","lang":"en","text":"I hope more people do it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002216","lang":"en","text":"I have been offered another post.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002217","lang":"en","text":"How good! And what is the problem?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002218","lang":"en","text":"The salary is better, but I have to work Saturdays.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002219","lang":"en","text":"I advise you to compare the two offers calmly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002220","lang":"en","text":"I already have. I doubt it is a good decision.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002221","lang":"en","text":"It is normal that you have doubts. It is a risk.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002222","lang":"en","text":"I would wait until they give you more information.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002894","lang":"en","text":"When do you have to give an answer?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002895","lang":"en","text":"By Friday at the latest.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002896","lang":"en","text":"Then ask for more detail on Monday.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002897","lang":"en","text":"That is true, I did not ask about the hours.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002898","lang":"en","text":"It is important that you know before you decide.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002223","lang":"en","text":"Good advice. Thank you.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002224","lang":"en","text":"The paper publishes an article about the climate today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002225","lang":"en","text":"The sea temperature rose again this summer.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002226","lang":"en","text":"The article says air pollution is the problem.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002227","lang":"en","text":"Next summer will probably be hotter.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002228","lang":"en","text":"For the climate to improve, private transport has to be cut.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002229","lang":"en","text":"It is not a simple or a cheap solution.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002230","lang":"en","text":"But it is necessary that we start now.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002643","lang":"en","text":"The article is two pages long and full of figures.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002644","lang":"en","text":"I doubt everyone reads all of it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002645","lang":"en","text":"It is a shame people do not change.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002646","lang":"en","text":"I advise you to use public transport more.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002647","lang":"en","text":"I hope next summer is cooler.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002648","lang":"en","text":"I shared the article with two colleagues.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002231","lang":"en","text":"Even if the change is slow, the planet is grateful for it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002341","lang":"en","text":"Even if it is not perfect, it is a good agreement.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001731","lang":"en","text":"I want you to help me with this file.","type":"natural","note":"English uses an infinitive here — «I want you to help». Spanish cannot: a second person needs a second clause."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001732","lang":"en","text":"My boss wants me to improve my schedule.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001733","lang":"en","text":"I need you to send me the invoice today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001734","lang":"en","text":"I am asking you not to share my password.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001735","lang":"en","text":"Do you want me to save the file for you?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001736","lang":"en","text":"I would rather we sorted it out today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001737","lang":"en","text":"My parents want me to do a degree.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001738","lang":"en","text":"The company requires us to sign the contract.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001739","lang":"en","text":"I do not let anyone use my computer.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001740","lang":"en","text":"I am asking you to explain the difference to me.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001741","lang":"en","text":"I want you to look after your health.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001742","lang":"en","text":"We need someone to fix the app.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001743","lang":"en","text":"Would you rather I called you later?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001744","lang":"en","text":"The teacher wants us to share our notes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001745","lang":"en","text":"I suggest we talk about it tomorrow.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001746","lang":"en","text":"I hope you pass the exam.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001747","lang":"en","text":"I hope it does not rain tomorrow.","type":"natural","note":"«Ojalá» comes from the Arabic «law šāʾ Allāh», if God wills. It needs no verb of its own, and never takes the indicative."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001748","lang":"en","text":"I hope everything goes well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001749","lang":"en","text":"I hope the pollution goes down soon.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001750","lang":"en","text":"I hope you get the job.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001751","lang":"en","text":"I hope you enjoy the holidays.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001752","lang":"en","text":"I hope we get a more settled climate.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001753","lang":"en","text":"I hope it is nothing serious.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001754","lang":"en","text":"I hope the price does not go up again.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001755","lang":"en","text":"I hope the interview goes well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001756","lang":"en","text":"I advise you to save a little each month.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001757","lang":"en","text":"I recommend you compare the two offers.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001758","lang":"en","text":"I suggest you read the contract carefully.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001759","lang":"en","text":"It is better if you spend less this month.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001760","lang":"en","text":"It is important that you recycle plastic.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001761","lang":"en","text":"It is necessary for you to keep a copy of the file.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001762","lang":"en","text":"I advise you to avoid rush hour.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001763","lang":"en","text":"It is useful for you to learn to use the internet.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001764","lang":"en","text":"I suggest you get a second opinion.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001765","lang":"en","text":"It is reasonable that you want a better salary.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001766","lang":"en","text":"You may need more experience.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001767","lang":"en","text":"I doubt it is that simple.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001768","lang":"en","text":"I do not think the risk is that serious.","type":"natural","note":"«Creo que es» takes the indicative; the doubt lives in the «no». Negating the belief is what moves the second verb."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001769","lang":"en","text":"I do not think the solution is cheap.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001770","lang":"en","text":"I doubt the app works without the password.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001771","lang":"en","text":"It is unlikely they will hire us both.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001772","lang":"en","text":"I do not think the effort is worth it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001773","lang":"en","text":"I doubt this article is impartial.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001774","lang":"en","text":"It does not look as if the network is working properly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001775","lang":"en","text":"Maybe the user does not remember their password.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001776","lang":"en","text":"It is not obvious that the decision is fair.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001777","lang":"en","text":"I am glad you are finding work.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001778","lang":"en","text":"I am surprised nobody complains about the noise.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001779","lang":"en","text":"It annoys me that people throw rubbish on the ground.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001780","lang":"en","text":"It is a shame you cannot come.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001781","lang":"en","text":"It worries me that spending is going up so much.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001782","lang":"en","text":"I am surprised the show has such a big audience.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001783","lang":"en","text":"I am grateful you are telling me.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001784","lang":"en","text":"It is only natural that you are tired.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001785","lang":"en","text":"I am glad the company protects the environment.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001786","lang":"en","text":"I am explaining it so that you understand the risk.","type":"natural","note":"«Para que» always takes the subjunctive: a purpose is by definition something that has not happened yet."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001787","lang":"en","text":"We recycle so that the planet is in better shape.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001788","lang":"en","text":"I save the file so that it does not get lost.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001789","lang":"en","text":"I am saving so that my children can study.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001790","lang":"en","text":"I am writing it down so that it is clear.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001791","lang":"en","text":"We turn the temperature down so we use less energy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001792","lang":"en","text":"I am letting you know so you are not late.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001793","lang":"en","text":"We sign the contract so that everything is above board.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001794","lang":"en","text":"I use an app so that I do not forget anything.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001795","lang":"en","text":"When you arrive, call me.","type":"natural","note":"«Cuando llego» is a habit; «cuando llegue» is a single arrival still ahead. English uses one form for both."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001796","lang":"en","text":"I will tell you when I have the answer.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001797","lang":"en","text":"We will talk when you finish the project.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001798","lang":"en","text":"Before you sign, read the hours.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001799","lang":"en","text":"When I get paid, I will pay the bill.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001800","lang":"en","text":"As long as there is no solution, we carry on as we are.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001801","lang":"en","text":"Even if it is complicated, it is worth it.","type":"natural","note":"«Aunque» takes the indicative for a fact and the subjunctive for a concession: «aunque es tarde» admits it is; «aunque sea tarde» does not."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001802","lang":"en","text":"Even if you do not agree, it is the decision of all of us.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001803","lang":"en","text":"Even if the post is temporary, it gives you experience.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001804","lang":"en","text":"Even if the app is free, it has adverts.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001805","lang":"en","text":"Even if it is hard, I want to try.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001806","lang":"en","text":"Do not worry about the bill.","type":"natural","note":"The affirmative is «preocúpate», the negative «no te preocupes». Two different forms, and only the negative is the subjunctive."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001807","lang":"en","text":"Do not share the password with anyone.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001808","lang":"en","text":"Do not spend the whole budget in one week.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001809","lang":"en","text":"Do not complain without proposing a solution.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001810","lang":"en","text":"Do not hesitate to let me know.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001811","lang":"en","text":"Do not throw plastic in the bin.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001812","lang":"en","text":"Do not sign anything you do not understand.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001813","lang":"en","text":"Do not worry, we will fix it today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001814","lang":"en","text":"Do not forget to save the file.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001815","lang":"en","text":"Do not miss the chance.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002269","lang":"en","text":"Good morning, I am calling about this month's bill.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002270","lang":"en","text":"Tell me, what is the problem?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002271","lang":"en","text":"The bill is double what it is other months.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002272","lang":"en","text":"I am going to look at the figures.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002273","lang":"en","text":"I hope it is a mistake.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002274","lang":"en","text":"You are right, there is a mistake in the total.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002275","lang":"en","text":"Will you give me the difference back?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002899","lang":"en","text":"And next month's bill?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002900","lang":"en","text":"It will be normal, do not worry.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002901","lang":"en","text":"I would rather you confirmed it by email.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002902","lang":"en","text":"I will send it to you today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002903","lang":"en","text":"Thank you very much for sorting it out.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002276","lang":"en","text":"Yes, we will refund you this month.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002277","lang":"en","text":"I bought something two weeks ago and it has not arrived.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002278","lang":"en","text":"Do you have the parcel number?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002279","lang":"en","text":"Yes, here it is.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002280","lang":"en","text":"It is odd that it is not here.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002281","lang":"en","text":"It really annoys me, I need it for Saturday.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002282","lang":"en","text":"I apologise. We will send you another today.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002283","lang":"en","text":"I would rather you gave me my money back.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002284","lang":"en","text":"As you wish. We will do it right now.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002285","lang":"en","text":"Excuse me, do you have a moment?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002286","lang":"en","text":"Of course, go ahead.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002287","lang":"en","text":"The noise at night stops me sleeping.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002288","lang":"en","text":"I am sorry, I did not know it could be heard.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002289","lang":"en","text":"I am asking you to turn the music down after eleven.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002290","lang":"en","text":"You are right. It will not happen again.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002291","lang":"en","text":"Thank you, it is important that we both get some rest.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002292","lang":"en","text":"Let me know if it happens again.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002293","lang":"en","text":"Shall we look at this month's costs?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002294","lang":"en","text":"OK. The electricity went up again.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002295","lang":"en","text":"It is normal in winter, but it is a lot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002296","lang":"en","text":"I suggest we turn the temperature down.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002297","lang":"en","text":"Agreed. That way we use less energy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002298","lang":"en","text":"And it is better if we draw up a budget.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002299","lang":"en","text":"Good idea. Shall we share the wifi bill?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002300","lang":"en","text":"Yes, we will pay it between us.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002301","lang":"en","text":"The kitchen is very dirty.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002302","lang":"en","text":"You are right. Shall we draw up a rota?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002303","lang":"en","text":"That is a good idea. I will clean on Mondays.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002304","lang":"en","text":"And I will do Thursdays. Does that seem fair to you?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002305","lang":"en","text":"That seems fine to me. But I want us to write it down.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002306","lang":"en","text":"Of course, I will put it on the wall.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002307","lang":"en","text":"That way nobody complains afterwards.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002308","lang":"en","text":"And if somebody cannot, let them say so.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002309","lang":"en","text":"Do you mind if my sister comes on Saturday?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002310","lang":"en","text":"No, of course not. How many days?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002311","lang":"en","text":"Two nights. She will sleep on the sofa.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002312","lang":"en","text":"Perfect. Let me know when she arrives.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002313","lang":"en","text":"Thank you for being so kind.","type":"natural"}
