{"ref":"core-es:item:001174","lang":"en","text":"And where do I turn?","type":"natural","note":"When you have the direction but not the place."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001175","lang":"en","text":"Do I go past the bank?","type":"natural","note":"Names a landmark to confirm the route."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001176","lang":"en","text":"How many minutes is it?","type":"natural","note":"Asks for a number instead of a feeling."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001177","lang":"en","text":"Can I walk there?","type":"natural","note":"The question behind the question."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001178","lang":"en","text":"Is it better to go by bus?","type":"natural","note":"Asks for a recommendation, not just a distance."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001179","lang":"en","text":"That is very kind of you.","type":"natural","note":"Formal and warm."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001180","lang":"en","text":"Thank you, now I know where it is.","type":"natural","note":"Confirms the help worked."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001181","lang":"en","text":"Perfect, that's it. Thank you.","type":"natural","note":"Short, when you are already moving."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001182","lang":"en","text":"Thank you very much, that is a great help.","type":"natural","note":"For someone who went out of their way."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001183","lang":"en","text":"I take a size thirty-eight.","type":"natural","note":"When you know the local number."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001184","lang":"en","text":"I don't know my size here.","type":"natural","note":"Sizes differ by country, and saying so is normal."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001185","lang":"en","text":"I think it's the small size.","type":"natural","note":"Hedged, when you are guessing."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001186","lang":"en","text":"Where can I try the shirt on?","type":"natural","note":"Asks for the fitting room without naming it."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001187","lang":"en","text":"Can I try both on?","type":"natural","note":"For when you cannot choose yet."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001188","lang":"en","text":"Can I try this jacket on?","type":"natural","note":"Names the item you are holding."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001189","lang":"en","text":"I want to try the bigger size.","type":"natural","note":"A statement, after the first one did not fit."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001190","lang":"en","text":"I'll take this shirt.","type":"natural","note":"The plain decision."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001191","lang":"en","text":"I'll go with the blue one.","type":"natural","note":"Chooses between two."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001192","lang":"en","text":"I'd rather think about it a bit more.","type":"natural","note":"A polite no that leaves the door open."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001193","lang":"en","text":"How much is this shirt?","type":"natural","note":"Before you commit to trying it on."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001194","lang":"en","text":"How much are the two together?","type":"natural","note":"For two items at once."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001195","lang":"en","text":"Sorry, how much is it?","type":"natural","note":"When you missed the price the first time."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001196","lang":"en","text":"Can I pay by card here?","type":"natural","note":"Worth asking before you get to the till."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001197","lang":"en","text":"Good afternoon, I have a reservation.","type":"natural","note":"Opens the whole exchange in one line."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001198","lang":"en","text":"Yes, under the name López.","type":"natural","note":"The detail they actually need."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001199","lang":"en","text":"I have a reservation for tonight.","type":"natural","note":"Adds how long, unprompted."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001200","lang":"en","text":"I have no reservation. Do you have any rooms?","type":"natural","note":"The other case, and it happens."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001201","lang":"en","text":"What is included in the price?","type":"natural","note":"Open, so you hear about things you would not ask for."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001202","lang":"en","text":"Does breakfast cost extra?","type":"natural","note":"The question behind the question."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001203","lang":"en","text":"Does the room have a bathroom?","type":"natural","note":"Cheap rooms sometimes do not."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001204","lang":"en","text":"What time does breakfast start?","type":"natural","note":"The one you will need tomorrow morning."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001205","lang":"en","text":"What time does breakfast finish?","type":"natural","note":"More useful than when it starts."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001206","lang":"en","text":"What time do I have to leave?","type":"natural","note":"Check-out, without needing the word for it."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001207","lang":"en","text":"Does the restaurant open at eight?","type":"natural","note":"Proposes a time and lets them correct it."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001208","lang":"en","text":"What time does the bar close?","type":"natural","note":"For the evening."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001209","lang":"en","text":"Can I arrive later?","type":"natural","note":"When your train gets in at midnight."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001210","lang":"en","text":"Is there a bar near the hotel?","type":"natural","note":"Outside the hotel rather than in it."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001211","lang":"en","text":"What floor is my room on?","type":"natural","note":"Ask before you carry the bags up."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001212","lang":"en","text":"Where is the entrance?","type":"natural","note":"For a hotel with more than one door."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001213","lang":"en","text":"Do you have plans for the weekend?","type":"natural","note":"Opens without committing you to anything."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001214","lang":"en","text":"Shall we do something tomorrow?","type":"natural","note":"Direct, and easy to say yes to."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001215","lang":"en","text":"Are you free this afternoon?","type":"natural","note":"Checks first, suggests after."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001216","lang":"en","text":"What shall we do tomorrow?","type":"natural","note":"Assumes the plan and asks only what."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001217","lang":"en","text":"Do you want to go for a drink?","type":"natural","note":"The lowest-commitment suggestion there is."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001218","lang":"en","text":"We could go to the park in the afternoon.","type":"natural","note":"A suggestion with a time attached."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001219","lang":"en","text":"Shall we go to the new restaurant?","type":"natural","note":"Names somewhere specific."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001220","lang":"en","text":"Do you fancy a coffee?","type":"natural","note":"Apetecer is the natural verb for this in Spain."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001221","lang":"en","text":"What time shall we meet?","type":"natural","note":"The plain question."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001222","lang":"en","text":"Shall we meet at seven?","type":"natural","note":"Proposes a time rather than asking for one."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001223","lang":"en","text":"Could it be later?","type":"natural","note":"Moves the time without rejecting the plan."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001224","lang":"en","text":"Where shall we meet?","type":"natural","note":"The other half of the arrangement."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001225","lang":"en","text":"Perfect, see you on Sunday.","type":"natural","note":"Says the day back, which is what fixes it."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001226","lang":"en","text":"All right, eight o’clock then.","type":"natural","note":"Says the time back."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001227","lang":"en","text":"OK, I'll see you there.","type":"natural","note":"Casual, and very Spanish."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001228","lang":"en","text":"Great, see you tomorrow.","type":"natural","note":"Warm, for a plan you are pleased about."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001229","lang":"en","text":"Good afternoon, how are things?","type":"natural","note":"Time of day plus an opener, in four words."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001230","lang":"en","text":"Hi, I'm Luis. And you?","type":"natural","note":"Gives your name and hands the turn straight back."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001231","lang":"en","text":"Good evening, sir.","type":"natural","note":"Formal, and for after dark."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001232","lang":"en","text":"Hi, how is everything going?","type":"natural","note":"Warmer than ¿cómo estás? with someone you know."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001233","lang":"en","text":"Right, see you later.","type":"natural","note":"Bueno is what signals you are leaving."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001234","lang":"en","text":"See you tomorrow.","type":"natural","note":"When you know when."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001235","lang":"en","text":"Until next time.","type":"natural","note":"When you do not."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001236","lang":"en","text":"Have a good day, and see you soon.","type":"natural","note":"Warm without being long."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001237","lang":"en","text":"I usually don't have much time in the morning.","type":"natural","note":"A circumstance rather than an action."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001238","lang":"en","text":"I go to work by metro and arrive at nine.","type":"natural","note":"How you travel, and when you land."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001239","lang":"en","text":"I leave early and get to the school before eight.","type":"natural","note":"A different destination, the same shape."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001240","lang":"en","text":"For three days now.","type":"natural","note":"The bare answer, with desde hace."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001241","lang":"en","text":"Since last weekend.","type":"natural","note":"Anchors it to a day rather than a count."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001242","lang":"en","text":"It started yesterday morning.","type":"natural","note":"Says when it began instead of how long."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001243","lang":"en","text":"Yes, a slight temperature.","type":"natural","note":"Yes, with the degree."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001244","lang":"en","text":"No, I'm not taking any medication.","type":"natural","note":"The question they always ask."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001245","lang":"en","text":"I've been sleeping badly since Monday.","type":"natural","note":"Answers about sleep with a start date."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001246","lang":"en","text":"I'm eating well, but I'm very tired.","type":"natural","note":"Rules one thing out and offers another."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002995","lang":"en","text":"I'm eating well, but I'm very tired.","type":"natural","note":"Rules one thing out and offers another."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001247","lang":"en","text":"All right, I'll rest for two days.","type":"natural","note":"Accepts, and says how much."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001248","lang":"en","text":"All right, I'll take a tablet at night.","type":"natural","note":"Repeats the instruction back."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001249","lang":"en","text":"Understood. And if I am not better?","type":"natural","note":"Accepts, then asks the obvious next question."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001250","lang":"en","text":"Thank you. I'll drink plenty of water.","type":"natural","note":"Names the advice you are going to follow."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001251","lang":"en","text":"I have three meetings this week.","type":"natural","note":"How many, over what period."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001252","lang":"en","text":"I talk to the customers on the phone.","type":"natural","note":"For work that is meetings by another name."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001253","lang":"en","text":"On Mondays we have a team meeting.","type":"natural","note":"A regular one, anchored to a day."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001254","lang":"en","text":"It was a hard day, but a good one.","type":"natural","note":"Two verdicts at once, which is usually the truth."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001255","lang":"en","text":"I finish early today and I'm happy about it.","type":"natural","note":"The reason and the feeling together."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:002996","lang":"en","text":"I finish early today and I'm happy about it.","type":"natural","note":"The reason and the feeling together."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001256","lang":"en","text":"I get home tired, but calm.","type":"natural","note":"Tired is not the same as unhappy."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001257","lang":"en","text":"There is a shop very close by.","type":"natural","note":"The thing people ask about first."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001258","lang":"en","text":"The bus stop is right in front of the house.","type":"natural","note":"Names how close, not just that it exists."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001259","lang":"en","text":"There are no shops nearby. It is a problem.","type":"natural","note":"What is missing is as useful as what is there."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001260","lang":"en","text":"There is a very big park near the house.","type":"natural","note":"Puts the place first, which is natural in Spanish."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001261","lang":"en","text":"I live very well here.","type":"natural","note":"About the living, not the flat."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001262","lang":"en","text":"It's a bit small, but I like it.","type":"natural","note":"The honest verdict most people give."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001263","lang":"en","text":"I don't like the street, it's very noisy.","type":"natural","note":"Negative, and says exactly what about."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001264","lang":"en","text":"I want to move house next year.","type":"natural","note":"A feeling expressed as a plan."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001265","lang":"en","text":"What time does the next train leave?","type":"natural","note":"The question that starts every journey."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001266","lang":"en","text":"When does the next bus leave?","type":"natural","note":"Cuándo, when you do not need the exact hour."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001267","lang":"en","text":"Is there a later one?","type":"natural","note":"When the next one is too soon."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001268","lang":"en","text":"Does the train arrive before ten?","type":"natural","note":"About the arrival, which is what you actually need."}
